% The Magic rewrite cuts a query of three calls into supplementary
% predicates of the query's own, which a limit refusing one names as the
% query, since the query is what the reader wrote there.
edge(a, b). edge(b, c). edge(c, d). edge(d, e).
path(X, Y) :- edge(X, Y).
path(X, Z) :- edge(X, Y), path(Y, Z).
path(a, X), path(X, Y), path(Y, Z)?
